OL,3,GNEWSAEight vehicles torched in car wash
OL,4,Aarson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight vehicles were either damaged or
OL,7,Fcompletely destroyed in a suspected
OL,8,Farson attack on a car wash.
OL,10,FPolice officers and firefighters were
OL,11,Fsent to Epping Green Car Wash and
OL,12,FValeting, on Epping Road, in Epping
OL,13,FGreen, Essex, at 02:56 BST on Saturday.
OL,15,FUpon arrival, the Essex Fire and Rescue
OL,16,FService said it found "multiple
OL,17,Fvehicles alight" before fire crews
OL,18,Fmanaged to extinguish them by just
OL,19,Fbefore 04:00.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
